{
 "id": "fox-waveshine-usmash",
 "name": "Waveshine to up smash",
 "part": "punish",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "Run in, shine, slide after the opponent and up smash before it can shield",
 "why": "The shine sends a standing opponent sliding away, unable to act for about half a second. A wavedash out of the shine keeps Fox next to it, and the up smash lands before it recovers: Fox's kill move, from any shine he lands in neutral.",
 "switch": "success",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Run at the opponent and press down-B on top of it. X or Y on frame {JC} of the shine, an air dodge toward it as Fox leaves the ground, and the C-stick up as he can act.",
  "expect": "A try begins when the shine hits and is judged when the up smash lands or the opponent can act: it shields the moment its stun is over. In the last part it moves about; these are the opponents that slide from the shine and do not fall.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 300
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 3,
    "from": {
     "near": "NEAR"
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "B",
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": "NEAR"
    }
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 3,
    "hold": 200,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": "JC",
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "trigger": "R",
    "frame": "JC+J",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     "WX",
     "WY"
    ],
    "frame": "JC+J",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "frame": "JC+J+2",
    "hold": 200,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "cstick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": "UP",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: down-B out of the run. The shine hits: {opp} slides away",
   "JC": "Frame {JC}: X or Y out of the shine",
   "JC+J": "Frame {JC+J}: R, the stick toward it and down. Fox slides after it",
   "UP": "Frame {UP}: the C-stick up: an up smash"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "What the shine leaves",
    "text": [
     "Hit by the shine on the ground, {opp} slides away and cannot act for about 35 frames.",
     "The hit freezes both for 3 frames, so the shine takes a jump from frame {JC}, not frame 4. An air dodge into the ground on the first frame of that jump is a wavedash: with the stick toward {opp} Fox slides after it and can act on frame {JC+J+10}."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 300
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 3,
        "from": {
         "near": "NEAR"
        }
       },
       {
